{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooky Village! And we have many cats to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a beautiful monochromatic scenario, relax, and find all the cats to reveal the final colored art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 920 hidden objects to find!!! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the cats and paint the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Look for special cats and unlock bonus levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Spooky Village's Landmarks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect many cards and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Level - Spooky Village</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 cats to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Special Cats that unlock bonus levels and give hints. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 20 city people to help you earn radar hints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bonus Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels with different sizes and numbers of kittens to find.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horseman Groove: </strong>50 kittens + 3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Dark Lake:</strong> 75 kittens + 5 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Den of the Werewolves:</strong>\u00a050 kittens + 3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Witches Market:</strong>\u00a050 kittens + 3 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of the Screamers:</strong> 100 kittens + 5 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pit:</strong> 150 kittens + 10 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frank's Inn:</strong>\u00a0100 kittens + 8 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scarecrow's Fields</strong>: 75 kittens + 5 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nosferatu's Castle:</strong> 75 kittens + 5 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mausoleum:</strong> 100 kittens + 8 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Crypt:</strong> 100 kittens + 50 spooky creatures</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Blindness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2906280?t=1758552742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906280/77ec84b7a8e8ed6983ec3f3b5dcb507b86f59969/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758552742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906280/3cb84d6392e8312c37437571bf1c83de9e64b85e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758552742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2906280/3cb84d6392e8312c37437571bf1c83de9e64b85e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758552742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id